== answer ==
Replaced ```  return substitutions.reduce((text, [placeholder, value]) =>
    text.split(`\`${placeholder}\``).join(codeSpan(value)).split(placeholder).join(value), template);``` with ```  return substitutions.reduce((text, [placeholder, value]) => {
    const rendered = Array.isArray(value) ? value.map(codeSpanItem).join(', ') : codeSpan(value);
    const plain = Array.isArray(value) ? rendered : value;
    return text.split(`\`${placeholder}\``).join(rendered).split(placeholder).join(plain);
  }, template);``` in `js/agentic/code_task.mjs` and observed the result.
